        <mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5A6375&quot;&gt;Modules of the Rust engine, grouped by responsibility, and the crates around it. The engine is the single source of truth; the shell reaches it only through the &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,monospace;white-space:nowrap&quot;&gt;Store&lt;/span&gt; ports.&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="82" width="1000" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
